## Customize flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Process heaps (MH) and binaries (MB) take most of the memory. Address-order
## best fit and multiblock carriers of at most 512 KB (the default grows them
## to 5 MB) leave less free space stranded inside carriers and hand emptied
## carriers back to the OS sooner. On Fly's 512 MB machine the carriers held
## ~110 MB more than their blocks (load_test, 600 users).
+MHas aobf
+MHlmbcs 512
+MBas aobf
+MBlmbcs 512
